of Autonomy AI, with the numbers that made the room go quiet.

58
00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.520
Uber increased its AI budget by six times

59
00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:22.600
and got through the whole increase in four months.

60
00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.640
And of every $100 spent on AI,

61
00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.760
about 18 reaches code that actually ships.

62
00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:32.880
Now, in the rush to AI Native, some people are doing it wrong

63
00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.840
and it can be really, really expensive.

64
00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.840
Everybody heard of Uber and what's going on there?

