92
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.960
that actually gets shipped to users.

93
00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:15.040
A lot of it goes to stuff that gets reworked bugs that AI also generated,

94
00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.880
and you get this wonderful loop of spending more and more money in less

95
