00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:06.480
these open weights models like GLM 5.1 and so on, and can now

123
00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:11.440
do pretty much 80% of the work that you need to do.

124
00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:12.520
And so

125
00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.160
if you

126
00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:18.360
take as a meaningfully sized organization kind of your next three month

127
00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:22.360
token budget and instead invest in some hardware with like eight

128
00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:26.920
RTX six K pros in it, and then you use something

129
00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:28.280
or you build something that allows you

130
00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:32.440
to easily switch between different agents and different models.

131
00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:36.920
Then you can avoid getting locked into, like the OpenAI anthropic ecosystem,

132
00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:41.160
but you can still kind of burst out to like Claude

